pages.raw_text:
Custom Exceptions
A custom exception class is an exception class that inherits from System.Exception class &
represents a domain-specific exception
Used to represent the domain-specific errors stand-out of system-related (.NET) related exceptions.
Custom Exception class
public class CustomException : Exception
{
public CustomException() : base()
{
}
public CustomException(string? message) : base(message)
{
}
public CustomException(string? message, Exception? innerException) : base(message,
innerException)
{
}
}

